      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    spot_rate_short = 0.025\n    spot_rate_long = 0.035\n    period_short = 2\n    period_long = 5\n\n    # Calculate the annualized forward rate for the 3-year period\n    forward_rate = (\n        ((1 + spot_rate_long) ** period_long\n         / (1 + spot_rate_short) ** period_short)\n        ** (1 / (period_long - period_short))\n        - 1\n    )\n\n    # Convert to a percentage and round to two decimal places\n    answer = round(forward_rate * 100, 2)\n\n    # Return the answer\n    return answer\n```",
